         <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c==null}"><apex:param value="{!Today()}"/></apex:outputText> between {!Opportunity.Account.Name}  (&ldquo;your Company&rdquo; or &ldquo;you&rdquo; or &ldquo;your&rdquo;) and ICRA Limited (&ldquo;</span><span class="c5 c3">ICRA</span><span class="c3">&rdquo;) <!--with an Effective Date of &nbsp; <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd'/'MM'/'yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c!=null}" ><apex:param value="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c}"/> </apex:outputText> <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd'/'MM'/'yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c==null}" ><apex:param value="{!Opportunity.TodayDate__c}"/> </apex:outputText> (the &ldquo;</span><span class="c5 c3">Agreement</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;).--> &nbsp;The terms and conditions of the Agreement are incorporated herein by reference as if set forth in full herein. &nbsp;Undefined capitalized terms used in this SOW shall have the respective meanings set forth in the Agreement. &nbsp;This SOW identifies the Rating being provided by ICRA; and, when executed by both undersigned parties, together with the above-referenced Agreement, constitutes the complete contractual agreement between the undersigned parties with respect to the Rating and Transaction described herein.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c19 c5 c3">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DESCRIPTION OF RATING, TENURE OF THE SOW, REVALIDATION, CERTAIN UNDERTAKINGS AND WARRANTIES</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:5px;">1.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Definition. &ldquo;Credit Rating</span><span >&rdquo; or &ldquo;</span><span>Rating</span><span class="c3">&rdquo; refers to an opinion regarding the Securities under the Transaction, expressed in the form of standard symbols or in any other standardized manner, assigned by ICRA and used by the Issuer of such Securities to comply with a requirement specified by the Regulations. ICRA&rsquo;s Ratings do not address any other risk, including liquidity risk, market value risk, or price volatility. Any Rating must be construed solely as a statement of opinion and not a statement of fact. A Credit Rating is not an offer, invitation, inducement or recommendation to purchase, sell or hold any securities or otherwise act in relation to any issue, the relevant Issuer or the relevant Transaction to which this Agreement (inclusive of this SOW) relates or otherwise in connection with any associated transaction, entity, or matter. References in this Agreement (inclusive of this SOW) to &ldquo;rating&rdquo; or &ldquo;credit rating&rdquo; also encompass any revalidation of the Rating and the terms of this Agreement (inclusive of this SOW) will apply to any such revalidation of the Rating.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c18 c3"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">1.2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="border-bottom:0.25px solid black;font-size: 14px;">Description of Services.</span><span class="c3">. &nbsp;Rating for <strong>{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c}" /> </apex:outputText> {!Opportunity.Crore_or_Million__c}</strong> programme of issuing <strong>{!Opportunity.Instrument_type_4__c}</strong> debt security to be issued under private placement mode [(which is proposed to be listed)] [(which is not proposed to be listed)] [Note: </span><span class="c3 c9">strike out whichever is not applicable</span><span class="c3">] (hereinafter referred to as the &ldquo;</span><span class="c5 c3">Security</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;) of your Company. &nbsp;Upon acceptance or use of the Rating by your Company in the manner set out in clause D (I) of the Agreement, and subject to the terms and conditions of the Agreement, ICRA will keep the Rating under surveillance until the earlier of the date that the Rating is withdrawn in accordance with the provisions of the Regulations or the date that there are no longer any obligations outstanding under the Security. </span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">1.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="border-bottom:0.25px solid black;font-size: 14px;">Tenure of the SOW</span><span class="c3">. This SOW shall remain valid till the earlier of the date that the Rating assigned is withdrawn in accordance with the Regulations and ICRA policy on withdrawal of credit ratings framed thereunder which is available at www.icra.in or the date that there are no longer any obligations outstanding under the rated Security. Subject to applicable law, the Parties may terminate the Agreement only after withdrawal of the Rating assigned under this SOW.</span><!--<span class="c5 c60">&nbsp;</span><span class="c2">ICRA may withdraw the Rating, subject to ICRA having:</span>--></p>
      <!--<ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_63-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">rated the Security continuously for 5 (five) years or 50 % (fifty percent) of the tenure of the Security, whichever is higher; and</span></li>
         <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">received an undertaking from your Company that a rating is available on the Security.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15"><span class="c2">However, in case of multiple ratings on the Security (where there is no regulatory requirement for multiple ratings), ICRA may withdraw a rating earlier than the above-mentioned timeline, subject to ICRA having:</span></p>
      <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_71-0 start" start="1">
         <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">rated the Security continuously for 3 years or 50 per cent of the tenure of the Security, whichever is higher; and</span></li>
         <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">received No-objection Certificate (NOC) from 75% of bondholders of the outstanding debt for withdrawal of rating; and</span></li>
         <li class="c1 c27 c32 li-bullet-1"><span class="c2">received an undertaking from the issuer that another rating is available on that Security. </span></li>
      </ol>-->
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">1.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="border-bottom:0.25px solid black;font-size: 14px;">Revalidation of the Rating</span><span class="c2">. In addition to the above, if the Security is not issued by you within a period of 3 (three) months from the date of the letter communicating the Rating, the same would need to be revalidated before expiry of the 3 (three) months.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c7 c3"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">1.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="border-bottom:0.25px solid black;font-size: 15px;">Sanctions Warranty</span><span class="c2">. &nbsp;You warrant that neither your Company nor any other &lsquo;party concerned&rsquo; (as defined hereunder) is subject to individual or country sanctions imposed by the United Nations, United States, European Union, or United Kingdom. (&ldquo;Sanctions&rdquo;) by virtue of (i) being on a published sanctions list or (ii) located in a sanctioned country (any person or entity described in (i) or (ii) being a &ldquo;Sanctions Target&rdquo;), or (iii) owned (50% or more) or controlled by one or more Sanctions Target(s). You further warrant that your Company is not subject to any other economic or financial sanctions which prohibit the provision by ICRA of the services under this Agreement. The term &lsquo;party concerned&rsquo; includes any applicant, issuer, originator, guarantor, sponsor, or borrower participating in any rated transaction hereunder. Further no issuer  hereunder is predominantly engaged in commercial activity involving one or more sanctioned countries (presently Iran, Syria, Cuba, N. Korea, Russia, and the Crimea, Donetsk, and Luhansk regions of Ukraine). If any rating to be provided hereunder is for instruments intended to fund specific activity, you warrant that such activity is not subject to any prohibition or restriction under Sanctions, including but not limited to being located in, benefitting or involving commerce with a sanctioned country. You agree to notify ICRA forthwith if any of these warranties cease to be accurate, and that if ICRA determines it is prohibited by any applicable law or regulation from providing any of the services hereunder it may terminate such services to the extent permitted under all applicable laws.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c19 c5 c3">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FEES AND INVOICE ADDRESS.</span></p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
     
      <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100px; text-align:left;">2.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Initial Rating Fee payable by your Company to ICRA is {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.IRF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/- exclusive of applicable taxes.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      
        <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100px;">2.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Annual Surveillance Fee for monitoring of the assigned Ratings under this SOW will be {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.ASF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/-, exclusive of applicable taxes and shall be payable each year on the anniversary of the initial rating assignment. Payment of Annual Surveillance fee shall be due on receipt of the invoice and is not contingent upon the timing of performance of surveillance by ICRA. The said Annual Surveillance Fee shall be annually increased by&nbsp;
         <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c != 'Other' }">
            {! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c}
         </apex:outputPanel>
         <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c == 'Other' }">
            <apex:outputText value="{0,number,###0.00}">
               <apex:param value="{! Opportunity.Other__c }"/>
           </apex:outputText>%
         </apex:outputPanel> of the last paid Annual Surveillance Fee from each subsequent billing anniversary. Notwithstanding anything contained herein, ICRA shall charge a minimum Annual Surveillance Fee as per the fee structure available on its website i.e. www.icra.in which may be amended by ICRA from time to time irrespective of the value of outstanding debt. &nbsp;</span>
       </p>
      <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      
         <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">2.3 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;It is hereby clarified that notwithstanding your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify ICRA of your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating, any use of the Rating by your Company, in any manner whatsoever, shall constitute acceptance of such Rating and your Company shall be obligated to pay the Annual Surveillance Fee after ICRA becomes aware of the use of the Rating. Initial Rating Fee/Annual Surveillance Fee shall be paid by your Company within &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Payment_Terms__c}" /> </apex:outputText> days from the date of invoice, by way of cheque or demand draft (DD) or transfer through electronic medium in favour of “ICRA Limited”. ICRA reserves the right to recover interest on any delayed payment, at the rate of&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Delayed_Payment_Interest_Rate__c}" /> </apex:outputText>% p.a. on the amount due. All Fees as mentioned herein shall not be refundable under any circumstances.</span>
           </p>
     
      <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; padding-left:3px;">2.4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Invoices under this Agreement shall be sent by one of the following methods:</span></p>
